    "name": "Bob's Crystals",
    "steam_appid": 3659560,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A robot. A signal. A planet at risk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries after the alien technology that once protected Earth was forgotten, a deadly solar storm looms on the horizon. When a faint signal reactivates a long-dormant defense system, only one machine responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>BOB</strong> \u2014 a self-aware, surprisingly snarky robot with a mission: recover scattered crystals and reactivate ancient planetary defenses before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca0 Tile-Based Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate conveyor belts, fire zones, ice paths, and breakable floors in fast-paced, precision-focused levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Puzzle Logic Meets Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleporters, quicksand, and shifting conveyor patterns to outsmart every challenge \u2014 sometimes with brains, sometimes with quick feet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1 Crystal Defense Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the marker crystal against alien systems until it locks down. Dodge, weave, and survive in a hybrid between tower defense and arcade chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf99 Dual-Narrative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover Bob\u2019s journey through:<br>\u2013 A male narrator who delivers atmospheric worldbuilding<br>\u2013 A female AI voice \u2014 Bob\u2019s sarcastic consciousness \u2014 who offers hints, commentary, and comic timing</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 Marker Crystal Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden components that enhance marker crystals and unlock new gameplay elements as you explore deeper into ancient systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Fully Integrated Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the same tools used to create the campaign. Build your own levels, play community creations, and share your best work \u2014 all from within the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Dynamic Electro Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a soundtrack that fuses retro chaos with modern pulse \u2014 synth-heavy, adaptive music that responds to your gameplay and changes with each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Built with the Community, by a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bob\u2019s Crystals</i> is being developed by a solo dev \u2014 yep, just one person handling the design, code, art, writing, and way too many cups of coffee. Early Access is an important step to gather feedback and keep the game growing in the right direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing, and areas currently being explored include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding the number and variety of levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing new puzzle mechanics to deepen gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iterating on the Marker Crystal Defense mode with potential new enemies and upgrade ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding more voice lines and narrative moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improving visuals, performance, and overall balance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fixed roadmap or guaranteed features \u2014 just a continued effort to improve and expand the experience with input from the community. If you enjoy quirky puzzle-platformers with attitude, come be part of shaping <i>Bob\u2019s Crystals</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A robot. A signal. A planet at risk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries after the alien technology that once protected Earth was forgotten, a deadly solar storm looms on the horizon. When a faint signal reactivates a long-dormant defense system, only one machine responds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>BOB</strong> \u2014 a self-aware, surprisingly snarky robot with a mission: recover scattered crystals and reactivate ancient planetary defenses before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca0 Tile-Based Platforming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate conveyor belts, fire zones, ice paths, and breakable floors in fast-paced, precision-focused levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 Puzzle Logic Meets Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master teleporters, quicksand, and shifting conveyor patterns to outsmart every challenge \u2014 sometimes with brains, sometimes with quick feet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1 Crystal Defense Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the marker crystal against alien systems until it locks down. Dodge, weave, and survive in a hybrid between tower defense and arcade chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf99 Dual-Narrative System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover Bob\u2019s journey through:<br>\u2013 A male narrator who delivers atmospheric worldbuilding<br>\u2013 A female AI voice \u2014 Bob\u2019s sarcastic consciousness \u2014 who offers hints, commentary, and comic timing</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 Marker Crystal Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden components that enhance marker crystals and unlock new gameplay elements as you explore deeper into ancient systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Fully Integrated Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the same tools used to create the campaign. Build your own levels, play community creations, and share your best work \u2014 all from within the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Dynamic Electro Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a soundtrack that fuses retro chaos with modern pulse \u2014 synth-heavy, adaptive music that responds to your gameplay and changes with each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Built with the Community, by a Solo Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bob\u2019s Crystals</i> is being developed by a solo dev \u2014 yep, just one person handling the design, code, art, writing, and way too many cups of coffee. Early Access is an important step to gather feedback and keep the game growing in the right direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing, and areas currently being explored include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding the number and variety of levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing new puzzle mechanics to deepen gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iterating on the Marker Crystal Defense mode with potential new enemies and upgrade ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adding more voice lines and narrative moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improving visuals, performance, and overall balance</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no fixed roadmap or guaranteed features \u2014 just a continued effort to improve and expand the experience with input from the community. If you enjoy quirky puzzle-platformers with attitude, come be part of shaping <i>Bob\u2019s Crystals</i>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tile-based chaos meets crystal-powered mystery in this action-puzzle platformer adventure. Restore the shield. Save the world.",
